##Day 6 Notes (Important Only)

**1. Function:
'''
function greet() {
  console.log("Hello");
}
greet();
'''
-Function = reusable block of code
-Must call it to run

**2. DOM:
DOM = Document Object Model (the webpage structure)

**3. querySelector
'''
document.querySelector("#about p")
'''
-Selects an element from the page
-#about means id="about"

**4. textContent
'''
element.textContent = "New text";
'''
-Changes the text of an element

Key Point:
-JavaScript can select HTML elements and change them.
